  "releaseNotes": "More streaming correctness for consuming expressions over a streamed source: outermost(//X) with an inspection-only body, a per-item simple-map over outermost/remove with an outer predicate, a for-each over snapshot(path), a for-each whose path carries an intermediate positional predicate (e.g. employee[1]/empnum/text()), and arithmetic over a streamed text node (head(//PRICE/text()) + 1) all now produce correct results under xsl:mode streamable=\"yes\". Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.6. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
